  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 205</b></color></size>\n<b>Gold coin of Samudragupta</b>\n<size=74%>c. 335\u2013375 CE\n<i>Gold (dinara)</i>\nVarious museum collections</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nThe Gupta kings issued fine gold coins called dinaras. On this type Samudragupta is shown seated, playing a veena \u2013 a reminder that he was praised as a poet and musician as well as a conqueror. The Gupta period is often called a classical age of Indian art and learning.</size>\n<size=50%><color=#8A8A8A>Photo: Unknown / Public domain / Wikimedia Commons</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
